#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Marka la hawlgeliyo, Xulashada Miisaanka Otomaatiga ah ee la doortay waxay go'aamisaa xadka uu RRDtool isticmaalo: --alt-autoscale wuxuu iska indho-tiraa labada xad, --alt-autoscale-max wuxuu hayaa xadka hoose, --alt-autoscale-min wuxuu hayaa xadka sare, --alt-autoscale (oo aqbala labada xad) wuxuu hayaa labada xad. Marka la joojiyo, xadka hoose iyo kan sare ee la habeeyay ayaa si toos ah loo isticmaalaa. Xuduudaha Adag waxay xakameeyaan haddii qiimaha ka baxsan xadkaas ay ballaariyaan baaxadda jaantuska."

