#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Xaqiijinta Ku Dhex-dhisan</i> - Kadupul ayaa maamula xaqiijinta isticmaalaha, taas oo kuu oggolaanaysa inaad abuurto isticmaalayaal oo aad siiso xuquuqo qaybaha kala duwan ee gudaha Kadupul.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah ee Webka</i> - Xaqiijinta waxaa maamula server-ka webka. Isticmaalayaasha waa lagu dari karaa ama si otomaatig ah ayaa loo abuuri karaa galitaanka koowaad haddii la qeexay Isticmaalaha Qaab-dhismeedka, haddii kale waxaa la adeegsan doonaa oggolaanshooyinka martida ee la qeexay.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta LDAP</i> - Waxay oggolaataa xaqiijin ka dhan ah server-ka LDAP. Isticmaalayaasha si otomaatig ah ayaa loo abuuri doonaa galitaanka koowaad haddii la qeexay Isticmaalaha Qaab-dhismeedka, haddii kale waxaa la adeegsan doonaa oggolaanshooyinka martida ee la qeexay. Haddii qaybta LDAP ee PHP aysan shaqaynayn, Xaqiijinta LDAP uma muuqan doonto sidii ikhtiyaar la dooran karo.<br><br><i>Xaqiijinta Dhoowrka Domain ee LDAP/AD</i> - Waxay u oggolaataa maamulayaasha inay taageeraan kooxo badan oo kala duwan oo ka socda hagayaal LDAP/AD oo kala duwan si ay u galaan kheyraadka Kadupul. Sida Xaqiijinta LDAP oo kale, qaybta LDAP ee PHP ayaa looga baahan yahay si looga faa'iidaysto habkan.</blockquote>"

