#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph access is granted directly by a graph permission in every mode. Permissive also grants access when the user has permission for the graph's device or template. Restrictive requires permission for both the device and template when there is no direct graph permission. Device Based requires device permission, and Graph Template Based requires template permission. User and group policies are evaluated separately and their allowed results are combined. These modes trade query performance against fine-grained permissions on large installations."
msgstr "Helitaanka jaantuska waxaa si toos ah u bixiya oggolaansho jaantus hab kasta. Habka dabacsan wuxuu sidoo kale bixiyaa helitaan marka isticmaaluhu haysto oggolaanshaha qalabka ama qaab-dhismeedka jaantuska. Habka adag wuxuu u baahan yahay oggolaanshaha labadaba qalabka iyo qaab-dhismeedka marka uusan jirin oggolaansho jaantus oo toos ah. Habka Qalabka ku salaysan wuxuu u baahan yahay oggolaanshaha qalabka, halka Qaab-dhismeedka Jaantuska ku salaysan uu u baahan yahay oggolaanshaha qaab-dhismeedka. Siyaasadaha isticmaalaha iyo kooxda waxaa loo qiimeeyaa si kala gaar ah natiijooyinkooda la oggol yahayna waa la isku daraa. Hababkani waxay isku beddelaan waxqabadka weydiinta iyo oggolaanshooyinka faahfaahsan ee rakibaadaha waaweyn."

