#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Taariikh ahaan, maamulayaasha Kadupul waxay abuureen Hababka Gelinta Xogta oo fudud kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan amarrada sida \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" si ay u matalaan qiime tiro ah oo loogu talagalay in lagu isticmaalo Jaantusyada Kadupul. Noocyadii hore ee Kadupul, tani waa la oggolaa. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, tani waa hab aan ammaan ahayn maadaama ay u furto waddo isticmaalayaasha dhinac saddexaad si ay u daabacaan Qaab-dhismeedyada Xogta oo aan ammaan ahayn. Gudaha Kadupul ee casriga ah, dhaqamada noocan ah waa in laga fogaadaa. Hase yeeshee, waxaan bixinaa ikhtiyaarkan haddii aad leedahay Hababka Gelinta Xogta oo hore kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan Xarfaha Gaarka ah ee aan ammaan ahayn oo aadan u beddelin qoraallo maxalli ah oo ku jira galka 'scripts'. Marka ikhtiyaarkan aan la calaamadayn, Kadupul wuxuu xaddidaa xarfaha gaarka ah ee qaabka shell sida calaamadaha xigashada, qaansooyinka maroojan, xariiqyada toosan, diillimaha gadaal u janjeera, iyo calaamadaha backtick. Kadupul wuxuu sii wadaa oggolaanshaha calaamadaha ka-weyn iyo ka-yar waxyaabaha sida <path_cacti> iyo cabbirrada gelinta, laakiin haddii ikhtiyaarkan aan la calaamadayn, taasi waa xadka isticmaalkooda la oggol yahay."

