#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Haddii la calaamadeeyo, Kadupul wuxuu ku diiwaangelin doonaa macluumaad dheeraad ah oo LDAP ah diiwaanka Kadupul inta lagu jiro hawlaha Xiridda (Binding) iyo Raadinta (Searching)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Kadupul cannot determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Haddii Kadupul uusan go'aamin karin xawaaraha isku-xirka sababtoo ah ifSpeed ama ifHighSpeed midna aan la dejin ama ay yihiin eber, qiime intee le'eg oo ugu sarreeya ayaad rabtaa in lagu dejiyo RRDfiles-ka ka soo baxa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a Device Data Source is included in an Aggregate Graph, show that Graph along with other Device Graphs"
msgstr "Haddii Isha Xogta Qalabka lagu daro Jaantus Isugeyn ah, ku muuji Jaantuskaas iyada oo lala socdo Jaantusyada kale ee Qalabka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Haddii isticmaale la xaqiijiyo oo uu doorto 'Igu hay galitaanka', kuki xaqiijin ah ayaa lagu abuurayaa kombiyuutarka isticmaalaha taas oo u oggolaanaysa isticmaaluhu inuu ku jiro galitaanka. Kukiga xaqiijintu wuxuu dhacaa 90 maalmood oo aan la isticmaalin ka dib."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Haddii labada proxy ee ugu weyn iyo kan kaydka ahba la heli karo, ikhtiyaarkani wuxuu oggolaanayaa in la qaybiyo dhammaan codsiyada ku socda RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Kadupul will remember your Tree History between logins and when you return to the Graphs page."
