#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Haddii loo dejiyo Fudud, Jaantusyada iyo Ilaha Xogta waxaa laga abuuri karaa oo keliya Jaantusyada Cusub.  Haddii loo dejiyo Sare, abuurista Jaantuska iyo Isha Xogta ee qaabkii hore waa la taageerayaa."

