msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Magaca martigeliyaha DNS ama ciwaanka IP ee adeegaha proxy ee kaydka RRDtool haddii proxy-gu ku shaqaynayo qaabka MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Magaca martigeliyaha DNS ama ciwaanka IP ee adeegaha proxy ee RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee Threads-ka la oggol yahay geeddi-socodkiiba. OGOW: Laga bilaabo Kadupul 1.2+, dejintan waxaa lagu hayaa Xog-ururiyaha, tanina waa oo keliya Dejin Horudhac ah. Isticmaalka tiro ka badan marka la adeegsanayo Spine waxay hagaajin doontaa waxqabadka. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, hubi inaad leedahay xiriirrada MySQL/MariaDB oo ku filan si ay u taageeraan isla'egtan: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers). Waa inaad sidoo kale hubisaa inaad leedahay xiriirro dheeraad ah oo ku filan xiriirrada galitaanka isticmaalayaasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
