#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Kadupul 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Tirada caadiga ah ee geeddi-socodyada isku mar shaqeeya ee la fulinayo Xog-ururiye kasta. OGOW: Laga bilaabo Kadupul 1.2, dejintan waxaa lagu hayaa gudaha Xog-ururiyaha. Wixii hadda ka dambeeya, qiimahani waa oo keliya dejin horudhac ah oo loogu talagalay Xog-ururiyaha. Isticmaalka tiro ka badan marka la adeegsanayo cmd.php waxay hagaajin doontaa waxqabadka. Hagaajinta waxqabadka ee Spine waxaa ugu fiican in lagu xalliyo cabbirka threads. Marka la adeegsanayo Spine, waxaan ku talinaynaa tiro ka yar oo taa beddelkeeda la adeegsado threads. Marka la adeegsanayo cmd.php, ha isticmaalin wax ka badan 2x tirada xudunta CPU."

