msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples that will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Qiimahani wuxuu matalaa tirada muunadaha celceliska sare iyo hoose ee laga saari doono kooxda muunadaha ka hor inta aan la xisaabin Celceliska Kala-duwanaanshaha. Haddii aad doorato qiime ka baxsan xadka oo ah 5, markaas waxaa laga saarayaa 5-ta celcelis ee ugu sarreysa iyo 5-ta ugu hooseysa labadaba."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Qiimahani wuxuu matalaa boqolleyda ka sarraysa celceliska muunadda ee la hagaajiyay marka kuwa ka baxsan xadka laga saaro muunadda. Tusaale ahaan, Boqolleyda Kala-duwanaanshaha ee 100%% ee celcelis la hagaajiyay oo ah 50 waxay jaantuska ka saari doontaa muunad kasta oo ka badan tirada 100."

