msgstr "Marka la damiyo, Otomaatigga Kadupul si firfircoon uma abuuri doono wax Shay Geed ah. Tani waxay faa'iido leedahay marka la hagaajinayo dejinta Qalabka ama Jaantuska si looga fogaado abuurista Galitaan Geed oo cusub mar kasta oo aad kaydiso shay. Kicinta Xeerarka gacanta weli waa suurtagal."

