msgid "When enabled, Kadupul will not lock Graphs.  This allows a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Marka la daarayo, Kadupul ma qufuli doono Jaantusyada. Tani waxay oggolaanaysaa wax-ka-beddel gacanta ah oo degdeg ah oo lagu sameeyo Ilaha Xogta ee la xiriira Jaantus."

