msgid "Kadupul can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Kadupul wuxuu si toos ah u baadhi karaa shabakadda marka rakibiddu dhammaato. Tani waxay adeegsan doontaa xaddiga shabakadda ee hoose si loo xisaabiyo xaddiga IP-yada la baadhi karo. Ikhtiyaarro hore loo sii qeexay ayaa loo dejiyay baadhista kuwaas oo ay ku jiraan isticmaalka bulshooyinka 'public' iyo 'private' labadaba."

