msgstr "Kadupul waxay u baahan tahay dhowr qaybood oo PHP Modules ah in la rakibo si ay si sax ah u shaqeyso. Haddii mid ka mid ah kuwan aan la rakibin, ma awoodi doontid inaad sii waddo rakibidda ilaa la saxo. Intaa waxaa dheer, si loo helo waxqabadka nidaamka ee ugu wanaagsan Kadupul waa in lagu socodsiiyaa doorsoomayaal gaar ah oo nidaamka MySQL ah oo la dejiyay. Fadlan raac talooyinka MySQL sida aad doorbiddo. Had iyo jeer eeg dukumeentiga MySQL haddii aad wax su'aalo ah qabto."

