#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Midna ka mid ah Qalab-kordhinta Aasaasiga ah ee Kadupul, ilaa hadda, dib looma qaabeynin si ay ula shaqeeyaan Xog-uruuriyayaasha Fog.  Sidaas darteed, Qalab-kordhinta sida MacTrack, iyo HMIB, kuwaas oo u baahan marin toos ah oo qalabka ah ma la shaqeyn doonaan Xog-uruuriyayaasha Fog waqtigan.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, qalab-kordhinta sida Thold way shaqeyn doontaa ilaa inta Xog-uruuriyaha Fog uu ku jiro qaabka <b>'online'</b>."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collector's Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump its Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>FIIRO GAAR AH:</strong> Waxaad ku soo gashay Xog-uruuriye Fog.  Marka uu yahay <b>'online'</b>, waxaad awoodi doontaa inaad aragto oo aad maamusho inta badan Bogga Ugu Weyn ee Kadupul sidii adigoo isaga ku soo galay.  Sidoo kale, waxaa muhiim ah in la ogaado in Xog-uruuriyayaasha Fog looga baahan yahay inay isticmaalaan astaanta <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> ee Adeegyada Xoojinta Waxqabadka Kadupul, waxaana mar walba kugula talinaynaa isticmaalka Spine.  Marka Xog-uruuriyaha Fog uu yahay <b>'offline'</b>, Bogga Xog-uruuriyayaasha Fog wuxuu yeelan doonaa macluumaad aad uga yar.  Si kastaba ha ahaatee, wuxuu kaydin doonaa dhammaan cusbooneysiinta ilaa Kaydka Xogta iyo Adeegaha Webka ee Ugu Weyn ee Kadupul la gaari karo.  Ka dib wuxuu ku shubi doonaa natiijada miiskiisa Boost dib ugu celinta Kaydka Xogta Ugu Weyn ee Kadupul si loo cusbooneysiiyo."

